  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EEfteling has begun construction on a new family coaster, part of a broader multi-year investment plan for the park. Details on the ride\u0027s theming remain under wraps, though concept art suggests a fairytale-inspired layout consistent with the park\u0027s storytelling style.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
